fires this. The contact is tagged and the request is opened in the Sales pipeline so nothing lives only in an inbox.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_42", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1144, "y": -106, "width": 1048, "height": 342, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#9fd1a8", "backgroundColor": "#e8f6ea", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1982966163, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1526706730, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_43", "type": "text", "x": 1166, "y": -90, "width": 1004, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1f6b30", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 721762279, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 502922617, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "2 - CALL YOU FIRST, WHISPER, THEN CONNECT", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "2 - CALL YOU FIRST, WHISPER, THEN CONNECT", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_44", "type": "text", "x": 1166, "y": -54, "width": 1004, "height": 32, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 2120395275, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 253207297, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "GoHighLevel rings you first, reads the lead source, square footage and desired service in your ear, then bridges the customer in. Needs the\nthree form fields lead_source, square_footage and desired_service on the contact record, and a phone number on your user profile.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "GoHighLevel rings you first, reads the lead source, square footage and desired service in your ear, then bridges the customer in. Needs the\nthree form fields lead_source, square_footage and desired_service on the contact record, and a phone number on your user profile.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_45", "type": "rectangle", "x": 2390, "y": 90, "width": 3136, "height": 218, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#c7a6e3", "backgroundColor": "#f3e9fb", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 937195260, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1234510746, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_46", "type": "text", "x": 2412, "y": 106, "width": 3092, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#5b2c8c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 555512016, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1063497604, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "3 - IF THE CALL DOES NOT CONNECT, THE SEQUENCE STARTS", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "3 - IF THE CALL DOES NOT CONNECT, THE SEQUENCE STARTS", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_47", "type": "text", "x": 2412, "y": 142, "width": 3092, "height": 16, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1708957521, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1679116189, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Text, email, a manual call task, text, email. Every text sends from the Quo business number hosted into GoHighLevel under Settings, Phone Numbers, hosted messaging, so replies land on your number and in the GoHighLevel conversation.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Text, email, a manual call task, text, email. Every text sends from the Quo business number hosted into GoHighLevel under Settings, Phone Numbers, hosted messaging, so replies land on your number and in the GoHighLevel conversation.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_48", "type": "rectangle", "x": 5726, "y": 74, "width": 1396, "height": 234, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e6c97a", "backgroundColor": "#fff5df", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 2132480061, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 346094056, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_49", "type": "text", "x": 5748, "y": 90, "width": 1352, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#8a5a00", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 714537755, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1929245187, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "4 - STOP THE MOMENT THEY REPLY OR BOOK", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "4 - STOP THE MOMENT THEY REPLY OR BOOK", "lineHeight": 1.